{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S05等较短段落里，未标时点的感受词也偏密，快速扫读时不如Y的双栏结构清爽。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮关键词让每段真正重要的心理变化和行为动机更容易被抓住，尤其是从想靠近、害怕失去，到愿意坦然表达、接受未来不确定性的转变，层次比较清楚。更重要的是，感受提示与音乐的声部、和弦、音高、力度和流动变化相互对应，并通过适时出现形成连续的情绪发展，而不只是罗列形容词。Y的双栏确实更容易快速浏览，叙述也比较舒展，但右侧感受容易成为同时摆出的词语清单，音乐与心理变化之间的联系没有X那么细密。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d9608914-a27d-4670-aefa-6cfbeee9ed5a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T010354910608Z", "elapsed_seconds": 165.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:06:39.995942+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c9eb18a744c669fe1bdeebe628ad8da0d95a77cd43643cd97bb42a724a7db2bc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat